            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "镜头聚焦孟浩面部，捕捉他皱起的眉头和茫然的眼神，葫芦被攥得微微变形，动作细节清晰。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩的外形与当下迷茫状态清晰展现。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0004"
            ],
            "source_text": "",
            "speaker_key": null,
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "镜头转到少年正面，他身形有些瘦弱，穿着洗得干净的蓝色文士长衫，约莫十六七岁的年纪，个子不高，皮肤带着常年日晒的浅黑，清亮的眼睛本透着几分聪颖，此刻却紧紧皱着眉，指尖攥着一个葫芦，眼神里满是茫然。",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0004:001:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0005:001:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "dialogue",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "声音低沉，带着浓浓的疲惫和失落，尾音轻得几乎被风刮走。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩科举落榜的事实明确道出。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0005"
            ],
            "source_text": "“又落榜了……”",
            "speaker_key": "person_b67de643afe6",
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "“又落榜了……”",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0005:001:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0005:002:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "statement",
            "kind": "action",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "胸廓随叹气动作起伏，肩膀放松垮下，头微低。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩落榜后的失落情绪进一步流露。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0005"
            ],
            "source_text": "",
            "speaker_key": null,
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "孟浩沉沉叹了口气，肩膀微微垮下来。",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0005:002:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0006:001:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "dialogue",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "语气里带着自嘲，说到“几yu作呕”时带着明显的压抑和不甘，尾句上扬，满是对自己的怀疑。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩对科举道路产生强烈质疑。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0006"
            ],
            "source_text": "“考了三年，这三年来整日看那些贤者书籍，已看的几yu作呕，莫非科举真的不是我孟浩未来的路？”",
            "speaker_key": "person_b67de643afe6",
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "“考了三年，这三年来整日看那些贤者书籍，已看的几yu作呕，莫非科举真的不是我孟浩未来的路？”",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0006:001:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0006:002:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "statement",
            "kind": "action",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "嘴角扯出一个极淡的苦笑，视线落到手中的葫芦上，眼神里的光又暗了些。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩垂头看着手里的葫芦，神色黯淡。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0006"
            ],
            "source_text": "",
            "speaker_key": null,
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "他自嘲地扯了扯嘴角，低头看向手里攥着的葫芦，神色又黯淡了几分。",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0006:002:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0007:001:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "dialogue",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "语气苦涩，说到“去东土大唐”时声音微微顿了一下，满是遗憾，最后一句几乎是咬着牙说出来的，透着不甘与无奈。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩明确意识到科举理想破灭，对书生身份产生自我否定。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0007"
            ],
            "source_text": "“当官发财做个有钱人的理想已经越来越远，更不用说有钱之后去东土大唐……百无一用是书生。”",
            "speaker_key": "person_b67de643afe6",
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "“当官发财做个有钱人的理想已经越来越远，更不用说有钱之后去东土大唐……百无一用是书生。”",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0007:001:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0007:002:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "statement",
            "kind": "action",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "指尖无意识摩挲葫芦表面，眼神放空，脸上的苦笑久久没有散去。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩的迷茫情绪到达顶峰，对未来充满恐慌。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0007"
            ],
            "source_text": "",
            "speaker_key": null,
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "孟浩苦笑着摇了摇头，坐在安静的山顶，指尖摩挲着葫芦的表皮，眼里的茫然越来越深，藏着对未知未来的恐惧。",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0007:002:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0008:001:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "statement",
            "kind": "action",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "镜头略微虚化，配合快速闪回的模糊想象片段，体现孟浩思绪的杂乱。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩陷入对未来的无序想象中，更加找不到方向。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0008"
            ],
            "source_text": "",
            "speaker_key": null,
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "各种纷乱的念头在他脑海里盘旋：会不会有贵人赏识自己？会不会有深闺小姐中意自己？又或者自己一辈子都困在科举的循环里？",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0008:001:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0009:001:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "statement",
            "kind": "action",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "孟浩微微打了个寒颤，指尖更用力地攥紧葫芦，指节微微发白。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩被迷茫情绪裹挟，心生恐惧。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0009"
            ],
            "source_text": "",
            "speaker_key": null,
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "这些问题没人能给他答案，十六七岁的少年只觉得那看不到头的迷茫像一张无形的大口，要将他整个人吞噬进去，让他心底忍不住泛起一阵惧意。",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0009:001:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0010:001:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "dialogue",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "语气平静得近乎麻木，带着破罐破摔的自嘲，说完后许久没有出声。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩开始后悔选择读书科举的道路，对现实处境愈发不满。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0010"
            ],
            "source_text": "“哪怕是县城里的教习先生，每月也只有几钱银子，甚至不如王伯的木匠铺子赚钱，早知如此头些年不去读书，和王老伯去学木匠手艺，想来日后总算能解决温饱，好过如今一无所有。”",
            "speaker_key": "person_b67de643afe6",
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "“哪怕是县城里的教习先生，每月也只有几钱银子，甚至不如王伯的木匠铺子赚钱，早知如此头些年不去读书，和王老伯去学木匠手艺，想来日后总算能解决温饱，好过如今一无所有。”",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0010:001:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "chain_key": "",
            "event_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0010:002:event",
            "event_priority": "causal",
            "function": "statement",
            "kind": "action",
            "narrative_layer": "story",
            "onscreen_entity_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
            "participant_deliveries": [],
            "performance": "孟浩双唇紧抿，不再说话，只有衣摆被风吹动的声响。",
            "render_policy": "standalone",
            "resulting_state": "孟浩陷入沉默，情绪沉淀下来。",
            "source_segment_ids": [
              "SRC0010"
            ],
            "source_text": "",
            "speaker_key": null,
            "target_keys": [],
            "text": "孟浩沉默下来，只有风掠过他耳边的声音。",
            "unit_key": "bp-sc002:SRC0010:002:unit"
          },
          {
            "actor_keys": [
              "person_b67de643afe6"
            ],
